  "focus": "\n    搜索Ctrl+⇧+J任务自动化Porpita 手机端新功能项目0~未生效~home命令\n    To pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.\n    While draggin",
  "section": [],
  "text": "搜索\n任务\n自动化\nPorpita 手机端\n新功能\n项目\n0\n~\n未生效\n~\nhome\n命令\n~\n名称\n内容\n.claude\n.codex\n.porpita\nAppData\nnotes.md\npreview.html\n关闭\n—\n·\n0\nPorpita\n1 / 6\n欢迎使用 PORPITA\nHow do you want to work with agents?\n\nPick where new agents open.\n\nAdd retry to fetchUser\n编辑了\napi.ts\n+1 -1\n12\n-\nreturn fetch(url)\n12\n+\nreturn withRetry(fetch, url)\n\nFailed requests now retry up to 3 times.\n\nAsk a follow-up…\nChat UI\n\nAgents reply in a chat, with rendered messages and diffs.\n\nAgents without chat support, and SSH or WSL projects, still open in a terminal.\n\nzsh — claude\n❯ claude\n> add retry to fetchUser\n● Update(src/api.ts)\n⎿ 1 addition, 1 removal\n12 - return fetch(url)\n12 + return withRetry(fetch, url)\n● Done. Retries capped at 3.\nTerminal\n\nEach agent's own CLI, exactly as it ships. Works with every CLI agent.\n\nNot a permanent choice. Switch any time in Settings → Chat UI.\n\n稍后设置\n继续\nCtrl",
  "dialogs": [
    "Porpita\n1 / 6\n欢迎使用 PORPITA\nHow do you want to work with agents?\n\nPick where new agents open.\n\nAdd retry to fetchUser\n编辑了\napi.ts\n+1 -1\n12\n-\nreturn fetch(url)\n12\n+\nreturn withRetry(fetch, url)\n\nFailed requests now retry up to 3 times.\n\nAsk a follow-up…\nChat UI\n\nAgents reply in a chat, with rendered messages and diffs.\n\nAgents without chat support, and SSH or WSL projects, still open in a terminal.\n\nzsh — claude\n❯ claude\n> add retry to fetchUser\n● Update(src/api.ts)\n⎿ 1 addition, 1 removal\n12 - return fetch(url)\n12 + return withRetry(fetch, url)\n● Done. Retries capped at 3.\nTerminal\n\nEach agent's own CLI, exactly as it ships. Works with every CLI agent.\n\nNot a permanent choice. Switch any time in Settings → Chat UI.\n\n稍后设置\n继续\nCtrl"
  ],
